<title>KUWAIT: Iran's oil minister to visit Kuwait February 23.</title>
<headline>Iran's oil minister to visit Kuwait February 23.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran's Oil Minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh will start an official two-day visit to fellow OPEC member Kuwait on February 23, the Iranian embassy said on Monday.</p>
<p>An Iranian diplomat said that cooperation between Kuwait and non-Arab Iran has developed in recent months.</p>
<p>Tehran last month signed a contract with the state Kuwait Petroleum Corp for the purchase of 750,000 tonnes of gas oil and kerosene during 1997, Kuwaiti and Iranian sources said.</p>
</text>
